<title>USA: Korea Telecom sells $200 mln 7.625 pct notes.</title>
<headline>Korea Telecom sells $200 mln 7.625 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Korea Telecom was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>Korea Telecom is a local and long-distance telephone service provider.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOREA TELECOM</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 4/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 98.994  FIRST PAY DATE 10/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.771 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 90 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
